No further information is needed. The evidence is comprehensive, consistent across multiple independent sources, and leaves no ambiguity about the true content and origin of the video.

## Conclusion

The evidence explicitly and clearly refutes the claim. The video does not show an attack on the French embassy; it shows the 2012 attack on the German embassy in Khartoum. No French embassy was attacked in Sudan in late October 2020. Therefore, the claim is `refuted`.

